{"id": "EUVD-2026-81890", "enisaUuid": "f252ab3b-3f63-3f3a-ba48-22d030dc6fde", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/sun4i: crtc: Propagate layer initialization error\n\nsun4i_crtc_init() returns plain NULL when layer initialization fails,\nwhile all its other error paths return an error pointer. The only\ncaller, sun4i_tcon_bind(), checks the result with IS_ERR() and happily\ncontinues with tcon->crtc set to NULL. sun4i_rgb_init() and\nsun4i_lvds_init() then dereference it in drm_crtc_mask(), which\noopses.\n\nReturn the error pointer instead.", "datePublished": "2026-09-17T16:08:22", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:01:15", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/aaf812960fb5ade24be7a1d8fea27a1ffc458c30", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e216d6168f25a69e5ae5b981ee73b3a860a46441", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2bb3169788f8296c8fc1e0d4fa6f1c6367cd5829", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1882112124a642de7571fbf354fa1929decbb3ef", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8f32af44d43332c02198752e596df00659bf4354", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/65bc02fec98e4e1d7d59d86cf2ddf8fd73dacb89", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c0d3219ffd4c0d42295e0dc949856067b7818b71", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7061ff05ed4a3cf16e83f7e3ad09cbd212508a32"], "aliases": ["GHSA-m975-xmq3-6qch", "CVE-2026-90297"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "15e70a04-8466-3749-84bb-ecba3dfadc0c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "dcd215801b0279f0a021516526cf7c0b67d5302e <8f32af44d43332c02198752e596df00659bf4354"}, {"id": "229030a5-567d-3a6b-878d-8a1694a2b410", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.110"}, {"id": "2307cb43-aa9c-3ff1-94af-58598fd5cc27", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.6"}, {"id": "2dac073e-012d-3b6a-bafa-d83044ce6305", "product": {"name": 